     "<div bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\" text=\"#000000\"><blockquote type=\"cite\">\r\n      -- <br>\r\n      You received this message because you are subscribed to the Google\r\n      Groups &quot;distance-sampling&quot; group.<br>\r\n      To unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it,\r\n      send an email to <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">distance-sampl...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\n      To post to this group, send email to <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">distance...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\n      To view this discussion on the web visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/distance-sampling/8cf166e9-7fc1-4dae-bc9e-13c63b21195b%40googlegroups.com?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=footer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/distance-sampling/8cf166e9-7fc1-4dae-bc9e-13c63b21195b%2540googlegroups.com?utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_source%3Dfooter&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792475370695000&amp;usg=AOvVaw17QIpnaKJo_fGveg0Xrz2Z\">https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/distance-sampling/8cf166e9-7fc1-4dae-bc9e-13c63b21195b%40googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\n      For more options, visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/optout\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/optout&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792475370695000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1lpfw4UrCo3PN3HIOB45Fw\">https://groups.google.com/d/optout</a>.<br>\r\n    </blockquote>\r\n    <br>\r\n    <pre cols=\"72\">-- \r\nEric Rexstad\r\nResearch Unit for Wildlife Population Assessment\r\nCentre for Research into Ecological and Environmental Modelling\r\nUniversity of St. Andrews\r\nSt. Andrews Scotland KY16 9LZ\r\n<a href=\"tel:+44%201334%20461833\" value=\"+441334461833\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">+44 (0)1334 461833</a>\r\nThe University of St Andrews is a charity registered in Scotland : No SC013532</pre>\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n"
